cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  RM-DMVT: diagnosing discrete-marginal collapse in diffusion-augmented
  intrusion detection
message: If you use this software or its archived results, please cite the paper.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/jcl-ids-research/ids-imbalance-xai
authors:
  - name: Anonymous authors, manuscript under review
abstract: >-
  Implementation, reproduction driver and archived experiment results for the
  study of rank-matched correction of collapsed discrete marginals in
  diffusion-augmented intrusion detection, together with the measured
  applicability boundary of training-set augmentation. Author names are withheld
  while the manuscript is under anonymous review and will replace the
  placeholder entry on acceptance.
keywords:
  - intrusion detection
  - class imbalance
  - diffusion models
  - reproducibility
